AMIX: r_frontToBack, opaque batches drawn near to far (2026-11-07)

Core 1 tests depth before it textures a pixel, so opaque surfaces drawn
near to far cost less.  Within the opaque sort class the batches keep their
state; only their order and the order inside them change.  Off by default
(r_frontToBack 0).

